ambient(SAGBIBasis) -- The ambient ring of a SAGBIBasis computation object
**************************************************************************

  * Function: *note ambient: (Macaulay2Doc)ambient,
  * Usage: 
        result = ambient S
  * Inputs:
      * S, a *note SAGBIBasis: SAGBIBasis,, 
  * Outputs:
      * result, a *note ring: (Macaulay2Doc)Ring,, 

Description
===========

Returns the ambient ring of a *note SAGBIBasis: SAGBIBasis,. This is the
ambient ring of the generating *note Subring: Subring, This may be a *note
PolynomialRing: (Macaulay2Doc)PolynomialRing, or *note QuotientRing:
(Macaulay2Doc)QuotientRing,.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x,y,z];                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : S = sagbi {x^2, y^2, z^2}                                   |
|                                                                 |
|o2 = SAGBIBasis Computation Object with 3 generators, Limit = 20.|
|                                                                 |
|o2 : SAGBIBasis                                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : ambient S                                                   |
|                                                                 |
|o3 = R                                                           |
|                                                                 |
|o3 : PolynomialRing                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : Q = R / ideal(x^3 - y);                                     |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : S' = sagbi {x^3, y^2}                                       |
|                                                                 |
|o5 = SAGBIBasis Computation Object with 1 generators, Limit = 20.|
|                                                                 |
|o5 : SAGBIBasis                                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : ambient S'                                                  |
|                                                                 |
|o6 = Q                                                           |
|                                                                 |
|o6 : QuotientRing                                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------+

