AutoSubduceOnPartialCompletion -- Subduct subalgebra generators at the end of the sagbi algorithm
*************************************************************************************************

Description
===========

During the main loop in *note sagbi: sagbi,, if no new subalgebra generators
are added and the *note AutoSubduceOnPartialCompletion:
AutoSubduceOnPartialCompletion, flag is true then all current subalgebra
generators are subducted against each other. The autosubduction can be a
significant time investment, but it can speed up subsequent computations by
removing redundant generators.

