|                                                               |
|o3 = false                                                     |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : S' = subring {x+y+z,x*y+x*z+y*z, x*y*z};                  |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : isSAGBI S'                                                |
|                                                               |
|o5 = true                                                      |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+

