    quotient with respect to a subring
  * *note groebnerSubductionQuotient: groebnerSubductionQuotient, -- Extrinsic
    method for subduction quotients
  * *note ambient(Subring): ambient_lpSubring_rp, -- The ambient ring of a
    subring
