Recompute -- Flag for restarting a sagbi or isSAGBI computation
***************************************************************

Description
===========

If the flag is set to true, then the subalgebra bases computation starts from
scratch. This process constructs a *note SAGBIBasis: SAGBIBasis, and uses the
computation options from the previous computation.

If the flag is set to false (the typical case), then previous computations are
used to speed up subsequent calculations.

