ReduceNewGenerators -- Flag for reducing new generators in Sagbi algorithm
**************************************************************************

Description
===========

The function *note sagbi: sagbi, computes a subalgebra basis by subducting
S-pairs. Any resulting non-zero polynomials are added to the list of subalgebra
generators. If ReduceNewGenerators is set to true, then the new generators are
reduced (using Gaussian elimination) against the other new generators. This
process is quick and ensures that duplicate generators are not added to the
list of subalgebra generators.

