    subring
  * *note Matrix % Subring: Reduction in subrings, -- Remainder modulo a
    subring
  * *note RingElement % SAGBIBasis: Reduction in subrings, -- Remainder modulo
    a subring
  * *note Matrix % SAGBIBasis: Reduction in subrings, -- Remainder modulo a
    subring
  * *note Subring: Subring, -- The type of all subrings
  * *note SAGBIBasis: SAGBIBasis, -- The type of all subalgebra bases
  * *note groebnerMembershipTest: groebnerMembershipTest, -- Extrinsic method
    for subring membership

