  * *note Recompute: Recompute, -- Flag for restarting a sagbi or isSAGBI
    computation
  * *note RenewOptions: RenewOptions, -- Flag for reselecting the options for a
    subalgebra bases computation
  * *note Subring: Subring, -- The type of all subrings
  * *note SAGBIBasis: SAGBIBasis, -- The type of all subalgebra bases
