    a SAGBIBasis computation object
  * "flattenedRing(SAGBIBasis)" -- see *note flattenedRing: flattenedRing, --
    The flattened ring of a subring or sagbiBasis
  * *note forceSB(SAGBIBasis): forceSB_lpSAGBIBasis_rp, -- declare the
    generators to be a complete subalgebra basis
  * *note generators(SAGBIBasis): generators_lpSAGBIBasis_rp, -- Returns
